    "summary": "Guru Cerdas is a digital platform designed to empower and enhance the professional development of teachers, with a focus on improving teaching skills through the use of technology. It aims to provide educators, particularly those in resource-limited settings like Aceh, with accessible and flexible training opportunities to elevate their pedagogical practices. By integrating innovative learning tools and providing professional development resources, Guru Cerdas seeks to bridge the gap in education quality and help teachers thrive in an increasingly digital world.",
